&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English: Professional proficiency (written and spoken)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;French: Fluent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;7. Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We warmly encourage you to apply to any of our roles, even if you think you&#39;re not an exact match.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please click the &quot;Apply&quot; button to submit your application, this helps us make the best possible assessment and get back to you as quickly as possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manual screening of your CV by a recruiter and then an AI-powered screening conversation (10 min) with Emma, Mirakl&#39;s AI Talent Ambassador, to explore your background and motivation for the role. You will need to complete this step within 3 days, otherwise we won&#39;t be able to move forward with your application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiter call (30 min):&lt;/strong&gt; a conversation about your background, motivations, and an introduction to Mirakl&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical interview (45 min):&lt;/strong&gt; an assessment of your Java and web development skills through a technical discussion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STAR interview (1h):&lt;/strong&gt; a conversation with one or two team members to explore Mirakl&#39;s values and culture fit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We welcome collaborators with their diverse perspectives and experiences to power us forward. These often far exceed conventional job requirements and help us create a culture of continuous learning. If you’re ready to join a global leader powering digital transformation for 450+ of the world’s most innovative retailers and B2B organizations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of our recruitment process, Mirakl processes your personal data to review and manage your application and, where appropriate, to consider your profile for future opportunities. You can exercise your data protection rights at any time, and as further detailed in our policies. For more information about how we process your personal data and your rights, please consult our Recruitment Privacy Notice, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mirakl.com/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; in English and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mirakl.com/fr-FR/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; in French.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We may use Artificial Intelligence (AI) solutions to help streamline our hiring process, including screening applications, analyzing resumes, and assessing responses. While AI helps us work efficiently, all final hiring decisions are made by humans. For more information, visit our &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://info.mirakl.com/ai-guidelines-for-candidates-and-interviews&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI Guidelines for Candidates and Interviews&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Credit-based and consumption-based offerings are becoming central to how GitLab monetizes. The systems that meter, rate, and bill that consumption sit underneath all of it. You&#39;ll own the backend usage billing pipeline and its product direction while supporting the Monetization Platform and Infrastructure team as it modernizes the foundations underneath it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When another GitLab team launches a credit-consuming capability, you&#39;ll help them make it billable across GitLab.com, self-managed, and GitLab Dedicated. This is a technical, systems-oriented product role: success means building a monetization platform other teams can launch on quickly and correctly, rather than shipping customer-facing UI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product direction for metering, aggregation, and rating in GitLab&#39;s usage billing pipeline, including the Zuora and CustomersDot integrations that turn usage into invoiced revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make onboarding a new credit-consuming capability a repeatable process rather than a bespoke project each time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product teams on what to instrument, how to meter and price usage across GitLab.com, self-managed, and GitLab Dedicated, and what it takes to be billable on launch day. Stay ahead of their roadmaps so billing doesn&#39;t delay launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize pipeline scalability, performance, and reliability as consumption grows, balancing those investments against new capability enablement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own billing defect detection and remediation so errors surface before they reach a customer&#39;s invoice and billing outcomes remain auditable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Monetization Platform and Infrastructure team by framing problems, explaining the value of platform investments, and prioritizing them against operational risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track measures of billing accuracy, pipeline reliability, cost to serve per capability, and time to monetize so teams can make informed pricing decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning the product direction of consumption- or usage-based billing systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Zuora or a comparable billing and revenue platform, and an understanding of how product and finance systems interact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with prepaid, commitment, or credit-drawdown pricing models (balances, reservations, overage, expiration) and the edge cases they create in billing and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience launching new products or pricing models while coordinating across engineering, Finance, Legal, Compliance and go-to-market teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to bring together teams you don&#39;t manage around work their launches depend on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining problems for platform or backend teams whose users are often other teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written communication in an all-remote, asynchronous environment; you&#39;ll use issues, epics, and direction pages to lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with developer tooling, financial audit or revenue recognition, or an engineering background can help, but isn&#39;t required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You use AI tools as part of how you work: prototyping, analysis, spec writing, and investigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In Monetization, we coordinate across engineering, Finance, Legal, Compliance and go-to-market on new products and pricing models. Our remote, asynchronous work uses written issues, and epics to keep decisions visible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_actions__container c-message__actions&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
